# Añade estas variables en Vercel → Settings → Environment Variables

# AviationStack (gratis: 100 req/mes) → https://aviationstack.com
AVIATIONSTACK_KEY=your_key_here

# FlightAware AeroAPI (gratis: 10 req/min) → https://www.flightaware.com/aeroapi/
FLIGHTAWARE_KEY=your_key_here

# OpenSky Network no requiere API key (datos en vivo gratuitos)
